From: cucumberfeet <116314769+cucumberfeet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] pipewire: keep each app stream on only one channel

WirePlumber can leave the default-sink link when target.object is
updated to a Pipeweaver channel. Drop unmanaged links that are not the
mapped channel when the target is set, and refuse late links that
violate the same rule.

